<view class="page theme-{{theme}}">
  <view class="card hero">
    <text class="hero-icon">🎲</text>
    <text class="hero-title">设置&关于</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">Board Game & TTRPG Toolkit</text>
    <text class="hero-ver">v{{version}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">外观模式</text>
    <view class="theme-options">
      <view class="theme-option {{themeMode === 'light' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="light" bindtap="onThemeModeTap">
        <text class="theme-option-title">白天</text>
      </view>
      <view class="theme-option {{themeMode === 'dark' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="dark" bindtap="onThemeModeTap">
        <text class="theme-option-title">黑夜</text>
      </view>
      <view class="theme-option {{themeMode === 'system' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="system" bindtap="onThemeModeTap">
        <text class="theme-option-title">跟随系统</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="theme-status">
      <text>当前生效：{{themeLabel}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{themeMode === 'system'}}"> · 系统：{{systemThemeLabel}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">📖 简介</text>
    <text class="section-text">桌面冒险工具集是一组面向桌面角色扮演游戏（TTRPG）玩家的小程序工具，涵盖掷骰、角色生成、守密人辅助等功能，支持 Cairn、COC7、Liminal Horror 等多个规则系统。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">🔧 技术栈</text>
    <view class="tag-row">
      <text class="tag">微信小程序原生</text>
      <text class="tag">Glass-Easel</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">📄 开源许可</text>
    <text class="section-text">本项目代码基于 MIT 协议开源。</text>
    <view class="link-row" bindtap="onCopyRepo">
      <text class="link-text">📋 复制仓库地址</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">⛰️ 石冢 (Cairn) 许可</text>
    <text class="section-text">石冢 (Cairn) 角色数据由 Yochai Gal 创作，基于 CC-BY-SA 4.0 许可。中文本地化翻译由 ZzNoah 提供。</text>
    <text class="section-text footnote">数据来源：cn.cairnrpg.com</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">🚪 阈限恐怖 (Liminal Horror) 许可</text>
    <text class="section-text">阈限恐怖 (Liminal Horror) 由 Goblin Archives 创作 © 2023，基于 CC-BY-SA 4.0 许可。中文本地化翻译由 ZzNoah 提供。</text>
    <text class="section-text footnote">数据来源：zznoah.github.io/Ark/LH.html</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-text footnote" style="text-align:center;">© {{year}} 桌游兴趣小组</text>
  </view>
</view>
